The MetroPT-3 dataset is separate and is NOT relicensed here. It is distributed
by the UCI Machine Learning Repository under CC BY 4.0 (Davari, Veloso, Ribeiro
and Gama, 2021; DOI 10.24432/C5VW3R) and must be obtained from
https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/791/metropt+3+dataset. The derived sample in
`data/sample/` and the aggregated outputs in `data/processed/` are produced from
that dataset and carry its attribution and share-alike-of-source terms; retain
the citation when reusing them.
